WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.370
&gt;&gt;&gt; FOR KEVIN MCCARTHY, 218 IS
THE MAGIC NUMBER, THOSE ARE THE

00:00:04.370 --> 00:00:07.907
VOTES HE NEEDS TO BECOME HOUSE
SPEAKER WHEN REPUBLICANS TAKE

00:00:07.907 --> 00:00:11.811
OVER IN JANUARY BUT WITH A SLIM
MARGIN HE'S GOING TO NEED EVERY

00:00:11.811 --> 00:00:14.347
VOTE HE CAN GET.
IT'S GETTING TOUGHER.

00:00:14.347 --> 00:00:21.788
FIVE REPUBLICANS SIGNALLED THEY
PLAN TO OPPOSE McCARTHY FOR

00:00:21.788 --> 00:00:23.523
SPEAKER.
WHEN HE WAS ON THE SOUTHERN

00:00:23.523 --> 00:00:28.094
BORDER HE SAID THEY MIGHT
IMPEACH THE HOMELAND SECURITY

00:00:28.094 --> 00:00:32.866
SECRETARY IF HE DOES NOT RESIGN
FIRST.

00:00:32.866 --> 00:00:40.406
&gt;&gt; IF SECRETARY MAYOR KAS DOES
NOT RESIGN, HOUSE REPUBLICANS

00:00:40.406 --> 00:00:44.978
WILL INVESTIGATE EVERY ORDER,
EVERY ACTION, AND EVERY FAILURE

00:00:44.978 --> 00:00:49.582
TO DETERMINE WHETHER WE CAN
BEGIN IMPEACHMENT INQUIRY.

00:00:49.582 --> 00:00:53.052
&gt;&gt; WE HAVE A PLAN, WE'VE BEEN
PUTTING THAT FORWARD.

00:00:53.052 --> 00:00:57.457
McCARTHY HAS NO PLAN.
THE REPUBLICAN PARTY HAS NO

00:00:57.457 --> 00:01:00.093
PLAN.
THEY DO NOTHING EXCEPT DO

00:01:00.093 --> 00:01:10.570
POLITICAL STUNTS.
&gt;&gt; WE SHOULD NOTE THE DHS

00:01:10.570 --> 00:01:12.539
SPOKESMAN SAID MAYORKAS HAS NO
PLAN TO RESIGN.

00:01:12.539 --> 00:01:15.408
WE'VE BEEN LOOKING AT THE
NUMBERS FOR KEVIN McCARTHY WAND

00:01:15.408 --> 00:01:17.544
IT'S NOT CLEAR CUT WHAT THE PATH
LOOKS LIE.

00:01:17.544 --> 00:01:19.779
WHAT'S THE CONVERSATION ON
CAPITOL HILL RIGHT NOW?

00:01:19.779 --> 00:01:22.515
&gt;&gt; Reporter: IT'S ALL ABOUT THE
NUMBERS GAME.

00:01:22.515 --> 00:01:28.021
YOU AS YOU MENTIONED HE NEEDS
218 VOTES TO BE SPEAKER BUT

00:01:28.021 --> 00:01:32.692
KEVIN McCARTHY IS PREDICTING HE
HAS 222 REPUBLICANS TOTAL IN THE

00:01:32.692 --> 00:01:35.295
HOUSE.
WHICH DOING THE MATH HE CAN ONLY

00:01:35.295 --> 00:01:39.566
AFFORD TO LOSE FOUR REPUBLICANS
IN THE SPEAKERS RACE.

00:01:39.566 --> 00:01:42.402
HOWEVER A FIFTH REPUBLICAN CAME
OUT AND SAID HE'S GOING TO

00:01:42.402 --> 00:01:45.872
OPPOSE McCARTHY ON THE FLOOR
VOTE IN JANUARY.

00:01:45.872 --> 00:01:49.175
TAKE A LISTEN.
&gt;&gt; A GROWING NUMBER OF US WHO

00:01:49.175 --> 00:01:52.812
HAVE LOST FAITH THAT McCARTHY
CAN DO THE JOB.

00:01:52.812 --> 00:01:54.981
THE SPEAKER IS THE MOST
IMPORTANT POSITION AT THIS TIME

00:01:54.981 --> 00:01:59.719
IN THIS COUNTRY.
&gt;&gt; Reporter: SO WHAT THAT MEANS

00:01:59.719 --> 00:02:02.188
KAITLAN IS KEVIN McCARTHY IS
GOING TO HAVE TO CONVINCE ONE OF

00:02:02.188 --> 00:02:08.461
THOSE MEMBERS TO CHANGE THEIR
MINDS OR CONVINCE TO NOT SHOW UP

00:02:08.461 --> 00:02:11.564
TO THE VOTE WHICH WOULD LOWER
THE NUMBER HE NEEDS TO BE

00:02:11.564 --> 00:02:14.334
SPEAKER AND KEVIN McCARTHY
BETTER HOPE THERE'S NOT MORE

00:02:14.334 --> 00:02:15.635
REPUBLICANS WHERE THOSE CAME
FROM.

00:02:15.635 --> 00:02:19.072
&gt;&gt; WE KNOW THERE'S AN EFFORT TO
PUT MORE REPUBLICANS ON THE

00:02:19.072 --> 00:02:22.809
LIST.
HAS McCARTHY RESPONDED TO THIS?

00:02:22.809 --> 00:02:28.147
ANYONE'S NAME SUGGESTED TO
TAKEOVER IF HE DOESN'T SECURE

00:02:28.147 --> 00:02:34.587
THE VOTES TO BE SPEAKER?
&gt;&gt; NO ONE WOULD OUTRIGHT

00:02:34.587 --> 00:02:36.155
CHALLENGE HIM BUT STEVE SCALISE,
JIM BANKS.

00:02:36.155 --> 00:02:39.425
NONE OF THOSE PEOPLE WOULD
CHALLENGE KEVIN McCARTHY.

00:02:39.425 --> 00:02:41.127
KEVIN McCARTHY HIMSELF HAS BEEN
MEETING PRIVATELY WITH SOME OF

00:02:41.127 --> 00:02:44.864
HIS CRITICS.
HE'S BEEN MAKING PHONE CALLS.

00:02:44.864 --> 00:02:48.801
HE HAS NOT CUT ANY DEALS JUST
YET.

00:02:48.801 --> 00:02:50.469
I EXPECT THOSE TO COME IN THE
COMING WEEKS.

00:02:50.469 --> 00:02:54.841
BUT HE'S TRYING TO PUBLICALLY
SHOW HIS CRITICS WHAT SORT OF

00:02:54.841 --> 00:02:58.578
LEADER HE WOULD BE.
HE WAS ON THE SOUTHERN BORDER

00:02:58.578 --> 00:03:06.753
YESTERDAY THREATENING SECRETARY
MAYORKAS WITH IMPEACHMENT.

00:03:06.753 --> 00:03:10.023
CLEARLY THOSE COMMENTS WERE
DESIGNED TO WIN OVER CRITICS.

00:03:10.023 --> 00:03:12.558
&gt;&gt; IT IS GOING TO BE AN
INTERESTING JANUARY.

00:03:12.558 --> 00:03:17.096
WE HAVE A FEW WEEKS AHEAD.
&gt;&gt; YOU KNOW WHO I THINK WE

00:03:17.096 --> 00:03:21.834
SHOULD BRING IN TALK ABOUT THIS?
CNN POLITICAL COMMENTATOR AND

00:03:21.834 --> 00:03:29.075
HOST OF "SMERCONISH" LUCKILY HIS
NAME IS MICHAEL SMERCONISH.

00:03:29.075 --> 00:03:31.544
GOOD MORNING, MICHAEL.
WHAT'S GOING ON WITH KEVIN

00:03:31.544 --> 00:03:33.412
McCARTHY?
DOES HE HAVE THE VOTES AND WHAT

00:03:33.412 --> 00:03:35.682
HE DID AT THE BORDER, IS IT A
STUNT?

00:03:35.682 --> 00:03:40.053
SHOULD THEY BE TALKING MORE
ABOUT PRACTICAL, REAL SOLUTIONS

00:03:40.053 --> 00:03:43.890
TO THE IMMIGRATION CRISIS?
&gt;&gt; DON, I THINK IT'S ALL

00:03:43.890 --> 00:03:45.625
RELATED.
I THINK THE REASON HE'S ON THE

00:03:45.625 --> 00:03:50.396
BORDER IS BECAUSE OF THIS ISSUE.
HIS DESIRE TO BE THE NEXT

00:03:50.396 --> 00:03:52.065
SPEAKER OF THE HOUSE.
I THINK THAT KEVIN McCARTHY HAS

00:03:52.065 --> 00:03:56.702
THE WORST ODDS OF BEING THE NEXT
HOUSE SPEAKER EXCEPT FOR ALL THE

00:03:56.702 --> 00:04:00.340
OTHER REPUBLICANS BECAUSE YOU
CAN'T BEAT SOMEBODY WITH NOBODY.

00:04:00.340 --> 00:04:03.643
SO WHEN THE QUESTION BECOMES IF
NOT KEVIN McCARTHY, WHO?

00:04:03.643 --> 00:04:08.381
THERE'S REALLY NO NAME YOU CAN
FILL IN THE BLANK THAT YOU'LL BE

00:04:08.381 --> 00:04:14.454
ABLE TO HERD A SUFFICIENT NUMBER
OF CATS TO GET TO THE 218 OR

00:04:14.454 --> 00:04:18.324
WHATEVER THE NUMBER MIGHT BE
BECAUSE THEY VOTE BY SURNAME, IT

00:04:18.324 --> 00:04:22.095
COULD BE 216.
I DON'T SEE ANYONE WHO COULD

00:04:22.095 --> 00:04:24.630
DENY HIM.
&gt;&gt; YOU SAY HE HAS THE WORST ODDS

00:04:24.630 --> 00:04:27.567
BUT THINK HE'S GOING TO BE
SPEAKER?

00:04:27.567 --> 00:04:30.336
&gt;&gt; IT'S MY WEAK ATTEMPT AT A
PUN.

00:04:30.336 --> 00:04:33.573
HE HAS THE WORST ODDS EXCEPT FOR
ALL THE OTHERS BECAUSE I DON'T

00:04:33.573 --> 00:04:35.642
SEE ANYBODY WITH BETTER ODDS
THAN HE DOES.

